config BACKPORTS_VENDOR_COMPAT
	bool "Enable vendor driver compatibility layer"
	depends on BACKPORTS
	help
	  Enable compatibility layer for coexistence with vendor-specific
	  wireless drivers. This allows backports to work alongside or
	  as an alternative to vendor drivers.

	  The compatibility layer provides:
	  - Runtime switching between backports and vendor drivers
	  - Conflict detection and resolution
	  - Shared resource management
	  - Interface naming compatibility
	  - Configuration migration support

	  This is essential for devices with existing vendor wireless
	  drivers that need to maintain compatibility while using
	  backports for advanced features.

	  Say Y to enable vendor driver compatibility.

